{"id":"62fb0ae0625e80cb","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-prefix-counting.md","title":"Chaitin Prefix Complexity Counting Theorem","display":"thm-prefix-counting — Chaitin Prefix Complexity Counting Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-prefix-counting","aliases":["43-thm-prefix-counting"],"display":"thm-prefix-counting — Chaitin Prefix Complexity Counting Theorem","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 6.7.4","source_printed_pages":"103–104","source_pdf_pages":"123–124","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-prefix-counting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-prefix-counting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prefix-counting — Chaitin Prefix Complexity Counting Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 6.7.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"103–104"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"123–124"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>；自然数参数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left|\\max_{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n}K(\\sigma)-n-K(n)\\right|\\le c,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left|\\max_{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n}K(\\sigma)-n-K(n)\\right|\\le c,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n,r\\in\\mathbb N\\;|\\{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n:K(\\sigma)\\le n+K(n)-r\\}|\\le2^{n-r+c}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n,r\\in\\mathbb N\\;|\\{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n:K(\\sigma)\\le n+K(n)-r\\}|\\le2^{n-r+c}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>量词明确表示误差常数独立于长度与亏损。第二式给出的尾部计数强于单纯程序总数计数。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 6.7.4；印刷页 103–104，PDF 页 123–124。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left|\\max_{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n}K(\\sigma)-n-K(n)\\right|\\le c,","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall n,r\\in\\mathbb N\\;|\\{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^n:K(\\sigma)\\le n+K(n)-r\\}|\\le2^{n-r+c}.","display":true}],"bytes":1413,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-prefix-counting]] — Chaitin Prefix Complexity Counting Theorem"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848","e039afac1517f3d7"]}